  "title": "RYANAIR LAUNCHES RECORD MOROCCO WINTER SCHEDULE",
  "summary": "2 NEW AIRCRAFT ($200M INVESTMENT), 17 NEW ROUTES, & 5.3M LOW FARE SEATS Ryanair, Europe’s No.1 airline, today (Thurs, 6 Aug) announced its biggest ever Winter schedule in Morocco, offering 5.3m low-fares seats to/from 156 destinations, including 17 exciting new routes. These include new connections from Rabat to major European cities such as Stockholm and Krakow, from Marrakesh to Wroclaw, and from Agadir to Milan, Nuremberg, Bratislava and Gdansk. Ryanair’s record Winter 2026 schedule will […]",
